 "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No prior, future, or missing transfer can fund a Repay. A Transfer-only candidate is legal: cash moves, debt does not."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_repay_action", "label": "RepayAction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Referenced transfer must already have executed in this same candidate. Payer may be a third party with its own exact allowance; never require debtor == payer. Retained F.2 text is debtor-funded; this local rule is not that text."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_accrual_first", "label": "AccrualFirst Allocation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_principal_first", "label": "PrincipalFirst Allocation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_prorata", "label": "ProRata Allocation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zero-denominator INVARIANT guard belongs to allocation, not an additional state-admission rule. A valid settled obligation with zeros remains valid state under every allocation rule."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_conversion", "label": "Conversion Rounding none|floor|ceil", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zero settlement for a positive nominal discharge rejects. Dust needs a separate explicit future resolution; this kernel does not erase debt for free."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_cm04_cm09", "label": "CM04/CM09 Funded Transition Rationale", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Retained composition model f6f5ead6... reduces duty 50 to 30 after every Transfer is removed and leaves Payer cash 50 / Lender cash 0. That is the wrong financial transition: debt moves without the settlement-asset movement that funded it."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_prepared_repayment", "label": "PreparedRepayment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_repayment_bounds", "label": "REPAYMENT_BOUNDS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_repayment_kernel_uint128_before_division", "label": "UInt128 Before Division", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/repayment-kernel.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at":